OL,3,GNEWSAMental health trust's leaders need
OL,4,Ato improve - CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA watchdog says leadership needs to
OL,7,Fimprove at an NHS trust at the centre
OL,8,Fof an inquiry into the deaths of people
OL,9,Funder the care of mental health
OL,10,Fservices.
OL,12,FIn March, the Care Quality Commission
OL,13,F(CQC) inspected parts of the Essex
OL,14,FPartnership University NHS Foundation
OL,15,FTrust (EPUT).
OL,17,FIn a report published on Thursday,
OL,18,FVictoria Green, the CQC's deputy
OL,19,Fdirector of mental health in the East
OL,20,Fof England, said there seemed to be a
OL,21,F"disconnect between senior leaders and
OL,22,Ffront-line service".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
